Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Underpass Traffic Interaction" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasActor :actor2 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk2 .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Vehicle stopped unexpectedly in the tunnel." .

:actor2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Vehicle potentially encroaching the lane." .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Stationary vehicle blocking lane." .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential rear-end collision due to unexpected stop." ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:risk2 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of collision due to another vehicle intruding into the lane." ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .
```

